@title Monorepo Deployment Pipeline
@subtitle Quillstone Software, as of 2026-10-10
@author Developer Productivity
@width wide

## Pipeline diagram

diagram pipe dir=LR title="From pull request to production"
pipe: pr "Pull Request" user
pipe: lint "Lint and Unit Tests" fn
pipe: build "Build Image" fn
pipe: scan "Security Scan" fn
pipe: staging "Deploy to Staging" svc
pipe: integ "Integration Tests" fn
pipe: smoke "Smoke Tests" fn
pipe: approval "Manual Approval" team
pipe: canary "Canary 10%" svc focus
pipe: full "Full Rollout" svc
pipe: rollback "Auto Rollback" fn
pipe: pr -> lint
pipe: lint -> build : pass
pipe: build -> scan
pipe: scan -> staging : no critical CVEs
pipe: staging -> integ
pipe: integ -> smoke
pipe: smoke -> approval : pass
pipe: approval -> canary : approved
pipe: canary -> full : healthy 30 min
pipe: canary --> rollback : error rate above 1%

## Stage durations

data stages = Stage,Median (min),p90 (min); Lint and Unit Tests,7.5,13.4; Build Image,4.2,6.9; Security Scan,2.8,4.1; Deploy to Staging,3.1,5.0; Integration Tests,8.3,14.7; Smoke Tests,5.6,9.8; Canary 10%,30,30; Full Rollout,12,18
chart hbar stages x=Stage y=Median (min) unit=min labels title="Median duration per stage"
table stages

## Rules

- Manual Approval is required only for services tagged `tier-1`.
- Friday deploys after 15:00 local time are blocked.
- Auto Rollback pages the owning team.
